[node name="Body" type="Label" parent="Tutorial/Margin/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
autowrap_mode = 3
text = "Act I: Create Reactions

You have a timed petri dish. Paint elements, discover reactions, and earn Insight for seismic upgrades.

• Press R to start a run
• Left-click to paint the selected element
• Right-click to place walls
• Mix sand and water to make mud — your first reaction
• Boil water into steam, then condense it back to complete the steam cycle milestone

Open the encyclopedia (E) to track discoveries. Good luck, alchemist!"

